<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Daily Health Notes Support</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1d1d1f;
      background: #f5f5f7;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 48px auto;
      padding: 32px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #159fbd;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    a {
      color: #087ea4;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Daily Health Notes Support</h1>

    <p>
      Daily Health Notes helps you record symptoms, body temperature,
      blood pressure, medical tests, medications, and health trends.
    </p>

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Record daily health information</li>
      <li>Track symptoms and significance levels</li>
      <li>Record body temperature and blood pressure</li>
      <li>Schedule medication and medical-test reminders</li>
      <li>Manage health records for family members</li>
      <li>Review weekly and monthly trends</li>
      <li>Export your health records for backup</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Need help?</h2>
    <p>
      For support, feedback, or questions, email:
      <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">your-email@example.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Your health records are stored locally on your device unless you
      choose to export or share them. Please keep backups in a secure location.
    </p>

    <h2>Important notice</h2>
    <p>
      Daily Health Notes is intended for personal health tracking only.
      It is not a medical device and does not provide medical diagnosis,
      treatment, or emergency advice. Contact a qualified healthcare
      professional for medical concerns.
    </p>

    <footer>
      © 2026
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
